  "releaseNotes": "0.12.0: Added rand(), id(), labels(), IS NULL / IS NOT NULL, and CONTAINS / STARTS WITH / ENDS WITH. Added ORDER BY and LIMIT for WITH and support for sorting by variables omitted from RETURN. Fixed OPTIONAL MATCH and added row metadata support. Breaking backend API changes: removed generic ID parameters from execution interfaces and added IGraphNode.GetId().\nFull changelog: https://github.com/JornWildt/Cyphoid/blob/master/CHANGES.md",
